# Curex Secure Health 🏥
### Secure, Consent-Based Digital Health Record Sharing

Curex Secure Health is a healthcare web application designed to help patients manage their digital medical records and share them securely with authorized healthcare professionals. The platform aims to improve healthcare record accessibility while prioritizing patient consent, privacy, and accountability.

> **Demo notice:** Any sample patients, prescriptions, appointments, medical reports, or other example records used in demonstrations must be fictional and clearly labeled **DEMO DATA — NOT REAL PATIENT INFORMATION**. This project is a prototype and must not be relied on for clinical decisions.

