## 19. Limitations

Curex Secure Health is a prototype unless its security, integrations, and operational readiness have been independently verified.

Potential limitations include:

- External hospital integration may not be available.
- OTP and identity verification may require third-party services.
- Biometric and passkey support requires additional implementation.
- QR sharing must be validated against real authorization and expiry rules.
- AI summaries may be incomplete or incorrect.
- Medication safety alerts require reliable reference data and clinical validation.
- Deployment alone does not establish regulatory compliance.
- Security, privacy, and clinical suitability require appropriate review before real-world use.

Do not describe simulated integrations as live integrations.

